      ],
      "en": "The islands have seen, and fear. The ends of the earth tremble. They approach, and come.",
      "ko": "섬들이 보고 두려워하며 땅 끝이 무서워 떨며 함께 모여 와서",
      "source_text_hash": "588ca038fe4049ed9d106eca09a5ee919a7e9f834ecea6ac220e1850f6287b27",
      "translation_text_hash": "2cf090021901c44592f2c824595f8a9401cdb0abd294af7e119447a2f57ce6e4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "섬들이 보고 두려워하며 땅 끝이 무서워 떨며 함께 모여 와서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2cf090021901c44592f2c824595f8a9401cdb0abd294af7e119447a2f57ce6e4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:41:6",
      "sequence": 18458,
      "chapter_label": "ISA 41",
