      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 41,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "Behold, I have made you into a new sharp threshing instrument with teeth. You will thresh the mountains, and beat them small, and will make the hills like chaff.",
      "ko": "보라 내가 너로 이가 날카로운 새 타작 기계를 삼으리니 네가 산들을 쳐서 부스러기를 만들 것이며 작은 산들로 겨 같게 할 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "70272653dc8ab78a2902e0f358c71a8e658abaf8a91e4378478af9c560dfaab8",
      "translation_text_hash": "63f94d8be7bfee0b9fa9d363ff6ffc4e7794210855fb7dd54c7680aa7c7ede0c",
