        }
      ],
      "en": "that they may see, know, consider, and understand together, that the LORD’s hand has done this, and the Holy One of Israel has created it.",
      "ko": "무리가 그것을 보고 여호와의 손이 지은 바요 이스라엘의 거룩한 자가 창조한 바인줄 알며 헤아리며 깨달으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "adb4957fdf5df515897d82b029f0681f9e917834c8a0c6394634cf943dab8662",
      "translation_text_hash": "47521f833806be766c07b8676687d332e9044044329e8b2daceabc61124e8483",
